# C2 gate walk (tools/check_fixture_equivalence.sh, inc-10v7f): an orc barbarian
# made with the four creation settings of tools/fixtures/options-2026-08-22-b17.dat
# on (rolled hit points and mana, random gender, Beginner's Kit), SAVED at the
# end of creation with nothing played. Hits hp_roll, mana_roll, gender, the kit
# keys, thrown_quantity and the Barbarian script draws. Every menu entry is
# chosen by name; the attribute set is a prompt, not a menu, and takes the first.
a       # Initial Choices: [a] Create a New Character
n       # Alter the character generation options? -- no
y       # Your options will place the game in Explore Mode. Continue? -- yes
@choose "Orc"
@choose "Orc (Standard)"
@choose "Barbarian"
a       # Attributes: the first of the five offered sets
@choose "Neutral"
@choose "Alertness"
@choose "Athletic"
RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN
RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN
ENTER y # Done, and confirm keeping the ranks
@while "wish to worship" y
@choose "The Ambitious Conqueror"
@until "System Menu" ESC
@expect "System Menu"
b       # [b] Save and Continue
@dump:saved
